<title>UK: LW Rentenbank adds 50 bln lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank adds 50 bln lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 350 billion lire from 300 billion lire lead manager Credito Italiano and Morgan Stanley International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LW RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *350 BLN ITL   COUPON   **10.0	MATURITY    20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.375</p>
<p> NOTES	*LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 300 MLN LIRE ON 15.JAN.97</p>
<p>	     **FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN 19.5 PCT LESS TWO TIMES</p>
<p>		 6M LIBOR SEMI-ANNUALLY THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 CALLABLE AT PAR ON 20.FEB.00.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
